  m_Name: Guram
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Guram
  LastName: Kopaliani
  Nickname: Gura
  Occupation: Parking Lot Attendant
  CharacterDescription: Old, weathered, callused hands, speaks plainly and directly
  CharacterArc: "Late 60s. Guram has worked the same parking lot for twenty-two years
    and treats the crisis the same way he treats every inconvenience \u2014 with
    mild irritation and the expectation that it will eventually pass. His wife died
    four years ago. He does not talk about it. He does not talk about much. He shows
    up, does the job, and goes home. In the final days, with the lot shut down and
    nothing left to keep his hands busy, he has no strategy except to keep showing
    up \u2014 to the checkpoint, to whatever comes next."
  DateOfBirth: 08/04/1958
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 15 MAR
  IsResident: 1
  GivesPaperwork: 1
